The way the sound reaches the speakers (the head unit's source 287) is Moonride's (JustAnotherPU), as
aurelmarius' TVH Player (https://github.com/aurelmarius/bmw-apps) and M850i-amn's IPTV use it.

Two small games come with the app, Snake and Pad Test (games.pack). They were written for it and
are under the same licence; their source is in games/ of https://github.com/clucraft/nes-idrive.
No other game is included: beyond these the app runs .nes files its user supplies.

